# Optional PX4 params overlay for external-vision fusion (NOT applied by default).
# GPS baseline must keep EKF2_EV_CTRL=0. To experiment after OpenVINS tracks:
#   1) Publish geometry_msgs/PoseWithCovarianceStamped or PX4
#      vehicle_visual_odometry from /ov_msckf/odomimu (frame conversions apply).
#   2) Set these via QGC / param set, then reboot the estimator:
# EKF2_EV_CTRL  :  horizontal position (1) + vertical (2) + yaw (4) as needed
# EKF2_HGT_REF  :  3 = vision (only if trusting VIO height)
# EKF2_EV_DELAY :  ms delay estimate
#
# OpenDroneLab does not change SITL defaults here. Use a dedicated session and
# restore GPS defaults afterwards. See docs/localization.md § OpenVINS.
EKF2_EV_CTRL 0
EKF2_HGT_REF 1
